module proof_communicated_memory
lineage L_A
lineage L_B
agent A lineage L_A
agent B lineage L_B
observe event by B content "B-observed-event" confidence 0.95
communicate event from B to A as event_at_A
proof p_access access event_at_A by A
proof p_origin origin event_at_A source B lineage L_B
proof p_clear clear event_at_A for A
proof p_ownership ownership event_at_A by A as communicated from ["p_access","p_origin","p_clear"]
write_memory event_at_A by A as communicated requires p_ownership
assert memory A contains event_at_A as communicated true
assert memory A contains event_at_A as observed false
